00:27:36,980 --> 00:27:38,620
-Yes.
-Lots of people have commented

569
00:27:38,620 --> 00:27:40,030
that they want to visit Shapu Village.

570
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:41,790
It's really great. Really great!

571
00:27:41,790 --> 00:27:42,920
I know. I know it all.

572
00:27:43,550 --> 00:27:44,590
I've been following

573
00:27:44,590 --> 00:27:46,520
your video channel for a long time.

574
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:47,590
Look.

575
00:27:48,810 --> 00:27:49,450
Look.

576
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:51,070
Right?

577
00:27:51,680 --> 00:27:52,000
Yes.

578
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:53,400
So you've been quietly

579
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:54,800
supporting us all along?

580
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:57,550
Uncle, so our village
doesn't need to be demolished now, right?

581
00:27:57,550 --> 00:27:58,110
Yes.

582
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:01,240
Where were you guys earlier?

583
00:28:01,720 --> 00:28:02,960
Well... Uncle Huixian,

584
00:28:02,960 --> 00:28:03,890
what do you mean?

585
00:28:03,900 --> 00:28:04,880
It's too late.

586
00:28:05,030 --> 00:28:05,790
Many households

587
00:28:05,790 --> 00:28:07,920
have already signed the consent form.

588
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:09,540
Then I'll go talk to everyone.

589
00:28:09,540 --> 00:28:10,470
Talk about what?

590
00:28:11,350 --> 00:28:14,400
You can't persuade everyone
to break the contract, can you?

591
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:16,060
So we have no other choice now?

592
00:28:16,790 --> 00:28:18,920
Unless something unexpected happens,

593
00:28:18,920 --> 00:28:19,830
it's irreversible.

594
00:28:19,830 --> 00:28:20,570
Unless something unexpected happens,

595
00:28:20,570 --> 00:28:21,970
we'll have Shapu Village

596
00:28:22,110 --> 00:28:23,340
wrapped up soon.

597
00:28:29,870 --> 00:28:31,680
Just grab the stuff! Don't hurt anyone!

598
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:32,920
They're coming for us!

599
00:28:32,920 --> 00:28:33,590
Who are they?

600
00:28:33,590 --> 00:28:34,050
Come on!

601
00:28:34,110 --> 00:28:34,660
What are you doing?

602
00:28:34,660 --> 00:28:35,830
Don't do anything stupid, you guys!

603
00:28:35,830 --> 00:28:36,360
Hurry up!

604
00:28:36,400 --> 00:28:37,590
-Open it!
-Get out of the car!

605
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:38,520
What do you want?

606
00:28:38,790 --> 00:28:39,350
Open it!

607
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:41,510
Don't smash the car!

608
00:28:41,680 --> 00:28:42,480
Open the door!

609
00:28:54,480 --> 00:28:56,030
Qingxia, Zuxian,

610
00:28:56,270 --> 00:28:57,510
Chaowei, Dehua...

611
00:28:57,980 --> 00:28:59,220
They all signed.

612
00:29:00,030 --> 00:29:01,880
They all agreed to the relocation.

613
00:29:01,880 --> 00:29:03,610
This woman is quite something.

614
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:06,350
She's efficient,

615
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:08,440
decisive,

616
00:29:10,270 --> 00:29:11,590
and beautiful.

617
00:29:12,550 --> 00:29:14,290
I even miss Gao Jiaoqi.

618
00:29:14,720 --> 00:29:15,160
Yeah.

619
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:20,200
Because if a stupid villain like him

620
00:29:20,200 --> 00:29:20,960
hadn't left,

621
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:23,820
those high-level villains
wouldn't have shown up.

622
00:29:25,640 --> 00:29:26,400
We're doomed.

623
00:29:26,400 --> 00:29:27,200
We're doomed.

624
00:29:27,350 --> 00:29:28,750
We're doomed.

625
00:29:31,270 --> 00:29:33,000
We're really doomed this time.

626
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:33,510
Zhen!

627
00:29:34,160 --> 00:29:35,290
Chief wants you guys

628
00:29:35,350 --> 00:29:36,210
to come with me.

629
00:29:37,070 --> 00:29:37,870
What's wrong?

630
00:29:37,960 --> 00:29:39,200
On County Road 205,

631
00:29:39,350 --> 00:29:40,830
Ms. Ma was robbed!

632
00:29:41,110 --> 00:29:41,920
Robbed?

633
00:29:42,070 --> 00:29:43,750
What does that have to do with us?

634
00:29:43,750 --> 00:29:44,310
Right.

635
00:29:44,310 --> 00:29:45,880
They left their money and phones alone,

636
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:47,350
but took the contract

637
00:29:47,350 --> 00:29:48,440
she'd signed with us!

638
00:29:48,440 --> 00:29:49,300
Did you guys...

639
00:29:57,160 --> 00:29:57,920
There

640
00:29:58,550 --> 00:29:59,750
should be no one here.

641
00:30:09,350 --> 00:30:10,440
An army is built

642
00:30:10,740 --> 00:30:12,070
for the day it's needed.

643
00:30:12,920 --> 00:30:15,310
All of you here are elites,

644
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:17,130
my trusted aides,

645
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:19,880
and relatives of my brother-in-law Fei.

646
00:30:19,880 --> 00:30:20,270
Fei.

647
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:22,640
Bring out the stockings.

648
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:24,200
Second Uncle.

649
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:26,890
Third Uncle.

650
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:31,310
Coach Liu.

651
00:30:31,310 --> 00:30:32,200
Who's this?

652
00:30:32,680 --> 00:30:33,680
My fitness coach.

653
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:35,160
He's one of us.

654
00:30:35,160 --> 00:30:36,020
Second Cousin.

655
00:30:36,350 --> 00:30:37,640
Will it be cold wearing this at night?

656
00:30:37,640 --> 00:30:39,770
This goes on your head, Second Cousin.

657
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:41,000
First Cousin.

658
00:30:41,400 --> 00:30:41,930
Jiaming.

659
00:30:43,750 --> 00:30:44,350
Everyone,

660
00:30:45,200 --> 00:30:45,920
listen up!

661
00:30:47,590 --> 00:30:48,790
Put on the stockings!

662
00:30:50,350 --> 00:30:52,680
Remember, in this operation,

663
00:30:53,240 --> 00:30:55,900
we only take the contract.
We won't hurt anyone!

664
00:30:56,400 --> 00:30:57,330
After it's done,

665
00:30:58,200 --> 00:31:00,400
I'll treat everyone to a fruit platter!

666
00:31:01,550 --> 00:31:02,110
Fei.

667
00:31:02,640 --> 00:31:05,680
No one supports my lofty ambitions,

668
00:31:06,030 --> 00:31:08,960
so I'll climb to the summit
through the snow on my own!

669
00:31:08,960 --> 00:31:10,510
Let's sing the battle song!

670
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:15,160
♪ Because we are family ♪

671
00:31:15,510 --> 00:31:18,270
♪ A happy family ♪

672
00:31:18,270 --> 00:31:19,030
Let's go!

673
00:31:19,160 --> 00:31:19,920
Okay!

674
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:28,400
Don't do anything stupid, you guys!

675
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:29,680
Destroy them.

676
00:31:34,500 --> 00:31:35,960
These aren't what I meant!

677
00:31:36,290 --> 00:31:37,160
Not mine either!

678
00:31:37,160 --> 00:31:38,110
The contract!

679
00:31:38,510 --> 00:31:40,110
The contract. The contract.

680
00:31:42,790 --> 00:31:43,590
Jiaoqi, look.

681
00:31:44,260 --> 00:31:45,790
So many people have signed.

682
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:04,640
Jiaoqi.

683
00:32:05,590 --> 00:32:07,050
Do you think this contract

684
00:32:07,100 --> 00:32:08,940
might be useful to Mr. Huang too?

685
00:32:15,030 --> 00:32:15,830
It's useless.

686
00:32:19,190 --> 00:32:20,190
It's useless now.

687
00:32:24,550 --> 00:32:24,960
Hurry!

688
00:32:40,070 --> 00:32:41,110
Did you do it?

689
00:32:45,600 --> 00:32:47,830
Me? Take the contract?

690
00:32:48,750 --> 00:32:49,410
Rob others?

691
00:32:49,550 --> 00:32:50,680
You think I'm crazy?

692
00:32:50,720 --> 00:32:52,590
How could I do something illegal?

693
00:32:54,650 --> 00:32:55,350
They might not know me,

694
00:32:55,350 --> 00:32:56,350
but don't you know me?

695
00:32:56,350 --> 00:32:57,590
I've been a coward since I was a kid.

696
00:32:57,590 --> 00:32:58,920
I might have the intention,
but not the guts.

697
00:32:58,920 --> 00:32:59,550
With my physique,

698
00:32:59,550 --> 00:33:01,410
I could have been beaten to death.

699
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:02,440
When I was bullied as a kid,

700
00:33:02,440 --> 00:33:03,970
I always asked you for help.

701
00:33:06,640 --> 00:33:08,170
In terms of combat power...

702
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:10,880
Sister, did you do it on impulse?

703
00:33:16,590 --> 00:33:18,240
Yes, I admit that

704
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:20,550
in terms of combat power,

705
00:33:20,680 --> 00:33:22,070
it does look like something I would do.

706
00:33:22,070 --> 00:33:24,270
But I prefer to use my brain.

707
00:33:25,030 --> 00:33:27,200
Such impulsive and reckless behavior,

708
00:33:27,200 --> 00:33:28,800
acting without thinking...

709
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:30,200
Jiahao,

710
00:33:31,070 --> 00:33:32,400
was it you?

711
00:33:37,270 --> 00:33:38,920
To be a good chief,

712
00:33:39,830 --> 00:33:41,790
you must be kind-hearted.

713
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:45,240
"No matter how many difficulties you face,

714
00:33:45,240 --> 00:33:47,240
you must never cross the line!"

715
00:33:47,680 --> 00:33:49,340
It's from my father's letter,

716
00:33:49,600 --> 00:33:51,880
first page, first line.

717
00:33:55,680 --> 00:33:56,310
Well...

718
00:33:57,060 --> 00:33:58,350
Who could it be?

719
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:05,440
I...

720
00:34:05,440 --> 00:34:06,270
Impossible.

721
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:08,440
-It couldn't be my sister.
-How could it be Zhen?

722
00:34:08,440 --> 00:34:10,110
Why couldn't it be me?

723
00:34:10,110 --> 00:34:10,800
Let me tell you,

724
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:11,960
for our village,

725
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:12,780
for our villagers,

726
00:34:12,780 --> 00:34:14,110
I could do anything!

727
00:34:14,760 --> 00:34:15,710
So it was you?

728
00:34:16,380 --> 00:34:16,840
No.

729
00:34:17,550 --> 00:34:19,360
So why did you act all righteous?

730
00:34:19,380 --> 00:34:20,630
You suspected everyone.

731
00:34:20,630 --> 00:34:22,090
Why didn't you suspect me?

732
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:23,360
Let's stop suspecting each other.

733
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:24,690
It's definitely not us.

734
00:34:25,280 --> 00:34:26,590
We just finished giving our statements.

735
00:34:26,590 --> 00:34:27,550
We have alibis.

736
00:34:27,760 --> 00:34:28,590
If it were us,

737
00:34:29,110 --> 00:34:30,320
would they have let us go so easily?

738
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:32,650
The police wouldn't have let us come back.

739
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:33,620
However...

740
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:36,250
There's someone

741
00:34:37,150 --> 00:34:38,230
we haven't seen.

742
00:34:38,800 --> 00:34:39,330
It's him?

743
00:34:40,590 --> 00:34:41,190
Who?

744
00:34:49,590 --> 00:34:50,400
You're back?

745
00:34:52,510 --> 00:34:53,760
This is all I have.

746
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:56,530
I'm going to turn myself in.

747
00:34:59,150 --> 00:35:00,950
In the future, during holidays,

748
00:35:01,220 --> 00:35:02,420
remember to visit me.

749
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:06,440
Ximei,

750
00:35:07,710 --> 00:35:08,970
take care of yourself.

751
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:11,030
Be happy.

752
00:35:16,960 --> 00:35:18,030
My old man...

753
00:35:21,550 --> 00:35:22,760
Don't worry.

754
00:35:23,030 --> 00:35:24,110
Leave him to us.

755
00:35:24,370 --> 00:35:25,630
We'll take care of him.

756
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:33,660
Keep doing what you want to do.

757
00:35:34,520 --> 00:35:36,320
No matter which one of you did it,

758
00:35:36,670 --> 00:35:37,800
I'll take the blame.

759
00:35:41,760 --> 00:35:42,490
I'm leaving!

760
00:35:44,440 --> 00:35:45,320
Sea!

761
00:35:45,320 --> 00:35:46,180
Come back here!

762
00:35:46,550 --> 00:35:47,920
Come back! Come back!

763
00:35:48,030 --> 00:35:49,150
Stop yelling!

764
00:35:50,540 --> 00:35:51,190
What blame are you talking about?

765
00:35:51,190 --> 00:35:53,030
How could you steal that contract?

766
00:35:53,030 --> 00:35:54,400
Isn't that illegal?

767
00:35:54,420 --> 00:35:55,480
Who exactly did it?

768
00:35:56,760 --> 00:35:58,480
What did we do?

769
00:35:59,700 --> 00:36:00,620
Wasn't it you?

770
00:36:00,840 --> 00:36:01,320
No.

771
00:36:01,370 --> 00:36:02,110
It wasn't us.

772
00:36:05,330 --> 00:36:06,460
It wasn't me either.

773
00:36:06,630 --> 00:36:08,030
Then why were you here...

774
00:36:08,110 --> 00:36:09,440
What blame are you going to take?

775
00:36:09,440 --> 00:36:10,030
Come on. You acted

776
00:36:10,030 --> 00:36:11,360
like some kind of hero.

777
00:36:11,360 --> 00:36:11,820
Go away!

778
00:36:14,360 --> 00:36:15,550
It wasn't him?

779
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:17,930
I know who it was!

780
00:36:19,230 --> 00:36:20,280
Could it be

781
00:36:20,630 --> 00:36:22,230
that some unsung heroes

782
00:36:23,280 --> 00:36:25,680
have been quietly protecting us all along?

783
00:36:28,230 --> 00:36:29,760
Do you believe in the light?

784
00:36:37,230 --> 00:36:40,150
The light of the righteous path

785
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:43,590
-shone across the...
-Stop it.

786
00:36:43,610 --> 00:36:44,180
Stop it.

787
00:36:49,320 --> 00:36:50,510
Didn't I tell you a long time ago

788
00:36:50,510 --> 00:36:52,400
to stop meddling in their affairs?

789
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:52,800
Look.

790
00:36:53,030 --> 00:36:53,840
How funny.

791
00:36:54,230 --> 00:36:54,760
Amazing.

792
00:36:56,510 --> 00:36:57,000
Thanks.

793
00:36:59,590 --> 00:37:00,790
Why are you laughing?

794
00:37:01,110 --> 00:37:03,110
They are here to give the money back.

795
00:37:03,950 --> 00:37:04,720
I was dazed.

796
00:37:05,180 --> 00:37:07,510
I thought
they were giving us wedding gifts.

797
00:37:07,510 --> 00:37:09,280
How can you be so laid-back?

798
00:37:09,570 --> 00:37:11,370
How many people have re-signed?

799
00:37:12,210 --> 00:37:13,930
Basically, no one.

800
00:37:15,030 --> 00:37:17,160
Pretty much none of them will re-sign.

801
00:37:17,230 --> 00:37:19,290
Haven't they all refunded the money?

802
00:37:20,480 --> 00:37:21,880
-Come here. This way.
-Seriously, Chief Chen.

803
00:37:20,510 --> 00:37:22,080
[Major Upgrade to Demolition Benefits
from Ma Construction Group]

804
00:37:22,150 --> 00:37:23,190
What's wrong with the villagers here?

805
00:37:23,190 --> 00:37:24,630
How could they go back on their word?

806
00:37:24,630 --> 00:37:25,800
This is so unfair.

807
00:37:26,320 --> 00:37:27,320
Ms. Ma, Ms. Ma.

808
00:37:27,400 --> 00:37:28,150
Many villagers

809
00:37:28,150 --> 00:37:30,280
didn't want to move in the first place.

810
00:37:30,530 --> 00:37:32,510
Now the movie they worked hard to make

811
00:37:32,510 --> 00:37:33,550
is about to be released.

812
00:37:33,550 --> 00:37:35,480
They are even more unwilling to sign.

813
00:37:35,480 --> 00:37:36,760
Aren't you the chief?

814
00:37:36,760 --> 00:37:38,190
Help us persuade them.

815
00:37:39,400 --> 00:37:43,110
I told your... Whatever his name is.

816
00:37:43,320 --> 00:37:44,380
I told him about it.

817
00:37:44,420 --> 00:37:45,510
When they listen to me,

818
00:37:45,510 --> 00:37:46,480
I am the chief.

819
00:37:46,670 --> 00:37:47,880
But when they don't,

820
00:37:47,880 --> 00:37:49,400
I am nothing.

821
00:37:49,980 --> 00:37:51,280
Now that they don't want to sign,

822
00:37:51,280 --> 00:37:53,110
I can't tell them to.

823
00:37:53,920 --> 00:37:55,400
How about this, Chief Chen?

824
00:37:55,400 --> 00:37:56,630
How about this? I have things to do.

825
00:37:56,630 --> 00:37:57,440
-Well...
-Thank you for your hard work.

826
00:37:57,440 --> 00:37:58,920
-Chief, well...
-You guys go ahead.

827
00:37:58,920 --> 00:38:00,330
Thanks for your hard work.

828
00:38:00,330 --> 00:38:01,210
Here, here.

829
00:38:01,710 --> 00:38:02,510
Refund the money here.

830
00:38:02,510 --> 00:38:03,320
This is ours.

831
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:04,280
Okay.

832
00:38:04,690 --> 00:38:05,920
Come on. Think about it.

833
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:06,630
Let's go.

834
00:38:06,630 --> 00:38:08,360
Think about... Think about...

835
00:38:11,640 --> 00:38:14,120
♪ Who says a couch potato can't dream? ♪

836
00:38:14,140 --> 00:38:15,800
♪ Have you ever asked that potato? ♪

837
00:38:16,350 --> 00:38:18,180
♪ Trying to be more delicious ♪

838
00:38:18,210 --> 00:38:20,810
♪ Is also great ♪

839
00:38:21,520 --> 00:38:23,840
♪ Get through the ups and downs ♪

840
00:38:23,860 --> 00:38:26,140
♪ Survive the heat and cold ♪

841
00:38:26,490 --> 00:38:30,390
♪ And you'll be sweeter than watermelon ♪

842
00:38:31,180 --> 00:38:33,780
♪ I'm just a little ♪

843
00:38:33,800 --> 00:38:35,750
♪ Just a little kid ♪

844
00:38:35,950 --> 00:38:37,520
♪ I have a dream ♪

845
00:38:37,540 --> 00:38:40,500
♪ And I dream big ♪

846
00:38:38,710 --> 00:38:42,110
Have fish balls and milk tea
as much as you want!

847
00:38:41,270 --> 00:38:42,300
♪ The most common ♪

848
00:38:42,320 --> 00:38:43,910
♪ Dramatic trick ♪

849
00:38:42,360 --> 00:38:48,110
The Three Gentlemen of Shapu
will have fun with you!

850
00:38:43,930 --> 00:38:45,650
♪ Is break down to build up ♪

851
00:38:45,680 --> 00:38:46,910
♪ Little figures ♪

852
00:38:46,930 --> 00:38:49,650
♪ Can also be the best ♪

853
00:38:50,400 --> 00:38:51,280
Work harder!

854
00:38:50,720 --> 00:38:53,040
♪ I'm a b-b-boy ♪

855
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:53,230
-Tomorrow will be better!
-Shapu!

856
00:38:53,230 --> 00:38:54,670
Keep on!

857
00:38:53,240 --> 00:38:55,330
♪ Who s-s-smiles all day ♪

858
00:38:54,670 --> 00:38:55,840
Come on!

859
00:38:55,810 --> 00:38:57,080
♪ Even with big, big troubles ♪

860
00:38:57,100 --> 00:39:00,020
♪ I'll laugh and curse them away ♪

861
00:38:57,550 --> 00:38:59,280
Zhen, you are the best!

862
00:38:59,280 --> 00:39:00,400
Come on!

863
00:39:00,410 --> 00:39:01,450
♪ Life will always ♪

864
00:39:01,480 --> 00:39:02,800
♪ Give you an Oscar ♪

865
00:39:03,040 --> 00:39:04,780
♪ For the role you play ♪

866
00:39:05,110 --> 00:39:06,510
♪ Be the king of comedy ♪

867
00:39:06,530 --> 00:39:09,710
♪ We're all on the same stage ♪

868
00:39:15,880 --> 00:39:16,610
Hand it over.

869
00:39:17,190 --> 00:39:17,840
What?

870
00:39:17,880 --> 00:39:18,920
The consent form.

871
00:39:18,920 --> 00:39:20,280
What consent form?

872
00:39:20,300 --> 00:39:21,900
Stop playing dumb, will you?

873
00:39:22,150 --> 00:39:22,760
I thought it was

874
00:39:22,760 --> 00:39:24,920
those people from Shapu Village
playing tricks.

875
00:39:24,920 --> 00:39:26,230
But then I thought it over.

876
00:39:26,230 --> 00:39:27,550
Stealing the contract—

877
00:39:27,550 --> 00:39:28,110
you're the only one

878
00:39:28,110 --> 00:39:30,070
low enough to pull a stunt like that.

879
00:39:30,070 --> 00:39:30,760
Feiyan,

880
00:39:31,360 --> 00:39:32,440
we're family.

881
00:39:32,510 --> 00:39:34,190
How could I do such a thing?

882
00:39:36,440 --> 00:39:36,960
Fine.

883
00:39:37,510 --> 00:39:39,230
I never expected you to admit it.

884
00:39:39,230 --> 00:39:40,360
But I'm warning you.

885
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:42,150
If you dare to pull

886
00:39:42,150 --> 00:39:43,510
any more dirty little tricks
behind my back,

887
00:39:43,510 --> 00:39:44,510
you'll regret it!

888
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:45,810
Let's go!

889
00:39:56,280 --> 00:39:57,710
I don't do little tricks.

890
00:39:57,710 --> 00:39:58,930
I go big!

891
00:40:01,320 --> 00:40:01,920
Come out.

892
00:40:06,610 --> 00:40:07,260
Mr. Huang.

893
00:40:09,190 --> 00:40:09,920
Hand it over.

894
00:40:11,290 --> 00:40:11,960
What?

895
00:40:12,320 --> 00:40:13,320
The consent form.

896
00:40:14,580 --> 00:40:15,440
The consent...

897
00:40:20,080 --> 00:40:21,880
The consent form. Give it to him.

898
00:40:23,590 --> 00:40:24,320
I don't have it.

899
00:40:24,320 --> 00:40:25,320
Isn't it with you?

900
00:40:26,710 --> 00:40:27,310
Mr. Huang.

901
00:40:27,440 --> 00:40:29,230
When we were stealing that form,

902
00:40:29,230 --> 00:40:30,360
it was so dangerous.

903
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:32,280
Over 20 of us crammed into a minivan,

904
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:34,530
then slammed on the brakes
to force their car to stop.

905
00:40:34,530 --> 00:40:36,110
We almost crashed into them!

906
00:40:36,110 --> 00:40:36,840
Give it to me!

907
00:40:38,550 --> 00:40:39,150
It's gone.

908
00:40:40,030 --> 00:40:40,690
Destroyed.

909
00:40:41,400 --> 00:40:42,260
Torn to pieces.

910
00:40:42,630 --> 00:40:43,760
Thrown into the sea.

911
00:40:47,440 --> 00:40:48,550
You tore it up?

912
00:40:49,180 --> 00:40:49,840
Yes.

913
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:53,320
We were worried it'd be dangerous
to keep it.

914
00:40:53,320 --> 00:40:54,820
So many people signed it.

915
00:40:54,920 --> 00:40:56,110
All the villagers signed it.

916
00:40:56,110 --> 00:40:56,920
It was scary.

917
00:40:56,920 --> 00:40:57,920
Where could we hide it?

918
00:40:57,920 --> 00:40:59,380
So we threw it into the sea.

919
00:41:01,030 --> 00:41:02,430
What are you looking for?

920
00:41:02,950 --> 00:41:04,010
Let's go! Let's go!

921
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:06,850
Get lost!

922
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:08,960
Get as far away as possible!

923
00:41:19,550 --> 00:41:20,550
Stop being angry.

924
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:21,680
Get in the car.

925
00:41:22,070 --> 00:41:22,870
Let me ask you,

926
00:41:23,150 --> 00:41:25,610
was our contract
snatched by Shapu Village?

927
00:41:27,960 --> 00:41:28,690
I don't know.

928
00:41:31,960 --> 00:41:33,820
Is there a village called Chuanao

929
00:41:34,240 --> 00:41:35,620
next to Shapu Village?

930
00:41:38,920 --> 00:41:39,650
I don't know.

931
00:41:41,360 --> 00:41:43,030
Didn't our Ma Group

932
00:41:43,590 --> 00:41:45,320
invest in this Chuanao Resort?

933
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:52,190
I don't know.

934
00:41:53,760 --> 00:41:54,290
Let's go.

935
00:41:54,720 --> 00:41:55,850
To Chuanao Village.

936
00:41:56,230 --> 00:41:57,010
Why?

937
00:41:57,490 --> 00:41:59,190
You have so many questions
but you know nothing!

938
00:41:59,190 --> 00:42:01,650
Ever heard of
"besieging Wei to rescue Zhao?"

939
00:42:01,650 --> 00:42:02,840
"Besieging Wei to rescue Zhao!"

940
00:42:02,840 --> 00:42:03,190
It's too cold.

941
00:42:03,190 --> 00:42:03,880
It's too cold.

942
00:42:03,880 --> 00:42:04,470
So cold.
